WEBVTT

1
00:00:59,333 --> 00:01:00,666
Hai, Kawan.

2
00:01:01,916 --> 00:01:03,583
Selamat pagi.

3
00:01:04,749 --> 00:01:06,458
Selamat pagi.

4
00:01:52,041 --> 00:01:53,707
Dasar bodoh!

5
00:01:53,708 --> 00:01:55,207
- Sophie?
- Kau tak apa?

6
00:01:55,208 --> 00:01:56,708
Aku tak apa!

7
00:01:59,874 --> 00:02:00,873
Tidak.

8
00:02:00,874 --> 00:02:03,790
Kau yakin dengan lagu audisimu?

9
00:02:03,791 --> 00:02:06,708
Ya, sampai aku membakar diriku
saat berlatih.

10
00:02:07,874 --> 00:02:11,040
Artinya kau sangat menikmatinya.
Itu pertanda bagus.

11
00:02:11,041 --> 00:02:15,457
Mungkin jangan menyanyi
dan mengeriting rambut bersamaan.

12
00:02:15,458 --> 00:02:16,957
- Baik.
- Tampak bagus.

13
00:02:16,958 --> 00:02:18,040
Benarkah?

14
00:02:18,041 --> 00:02:19,624
- Ya.
- Baiklah.

15
00:02:20,624 --> 00:02:22,915
Mallory akan dapat peran Jenna.
Semua tahu itu.

16
00:02:22,916 --> 00:02:24,332
Jenna adalah…

17
00:02:24,333 --> 00:02:28,333
Pelayan utama di <i>Waitress</i>.
Seperti memerankan Annie di <i>Annie.</i>

18
00:02:29,333 --> 00:02:32,123
Aku mungkin dapat peran Dawn,
temannya yang lucu.

19
00:02:32,124 --> 00:02:33,499
Aku mau tampil baik.

20
00:02:34,083 --> 00:02:35,791
Sayang, pasti bisa.

21
00:02:38,208 --> 00:02:39,915
AYAH

22
00:02:39,916 --> 00:02:41,373
Mengapa Ayah menelepon?

23
00:02:41,374 --> 00:02:43,040
- Entahlah.
- Halo?

24
00:02:43,041 --> 00:02:44,707
<i>Jangan menjilat adikmu.</i>

25
00:02:44,708 --> 00:02:46,540
- Salah pencet.
<i>- Ethan…</i>

26
00:02:46,541 --> 00:02:48,873
- Haruskah kita lakukan?
<i>- Adikmu menjilat lantai.</i>

27
00:02:48,874 --> 00:02:52,457
<i>Kalian berdua selalu begini.
Itu sangat kotor.</i>

28
00:02:52,458 --> 00:02:56,957
Sophie, terima kasih banyak
telah menunjukkan tato kupu-kupu

29
00:02:56,958 --> 00:03:00,457
yang membentang dari leher
hingga punggungmu. Amat menawan.

30
00:03:00,458 --> 00:03:04,373
Ya. Terima kasih
karena mengizinkanku melakukannya

31
00:03:04,374 --> 00:03:06,832
dan memintaku tak memberi tahu Ayah.

32
00:03:06,833 --> 00:03:11,083
Tentu, karena kita tahu ayahmu
tak setuju soal hak perempuan.

33
00:03:11,874 --> 00:03:13,832
<i>- Jilat sayuran saja.</i>
- Ayah tak dengar.

34
00:03:13,833 --> 00:03:14,791
Itu gila.

35
00:03:15,291 --> 00:03:17,790
Ted! Ponselmu!

36
00:03:17,791 --> 00:03:18,707
Lagi?

37
00:03:18,708 --> 00:03:20,040
- Ya!
- Bukan main.

38
00:03:20,041 --> 00:03:21,582
Boleh aku mencamil?

39
00:03:21,583 --> 00:03:23,332
Kau baru sarapan.

40
00:03:23,333 --> 00:03:25,707
- Itu benar.
- Tidak, tetapi serius?

41
00:03:25,708 --> 00:03:27,415
Hei, sudah sikat giginya?

42
00:03:27,416 --> 00:03:29,665
- Belum.
- Aku sikat gigiku dan Ethan.

43
00:03:29,666 --> 00:03:31,873
Ada bintik putih di lidahnya.

44
00:03:31,874 --> 00:03:32,873
Lidahmu juga.

45
00:03:32,874 --> 00:03:35,082
Bagel dan telurnya dihabiskan adik-adikmu.

46
00:03:35,083 --> 00:03:38,165
Namun, Ayah bawakan pisang.
Ya, pisang bukan bagel.

47
00:03:38,166 --> 00:03:40,082
- Tak apa, Ayah.
- Terima kasih.

48
00:03:40,083 --> 00:03:42,124
- Siapa mau digendong?
- Ayo.

49
00:03:42,833 --> 00:03:44,958
- Nanti aku jemput.
- Baik.

50
00:03:45,916 --> 00:03:47,499
Kami akan baik-baik saja.

51
00:03:48,208 --> 00:03:49,582
- Baik?
- Ya.

52
00:03:49,583 --> 00:03:51,208
- Aku cinta kau.
- Aku juga.

53
00:03:52,124 --> 00:03:55,333
- Jangan sampai terjebak macet.
- Bersikap baiklah pada adikmu.

54
00:03:59,291 --> 00:04:01,832
Kau cantik dan berbakat.

55
00:04:01,833 --> 00:04:03,332
- Astaga.
- Serta siap.

56
00:04:03,333 --> 00:04:04,583
Terima kasih.

57
00:04:06,166 --> 00:04:08,040
- Carolyn menunggu. Aku harus pergi.
- Ya.

58
00:04:08,041 --> 00:04:09,958
Ibu janji segera melatihmu menyetir.

59
00:04:10,833 --> 00:04:12,832
Boleh bilang "semoga sukses"?

60
00:04:12,833 --> 00:04:14,332
Katakan "patahkan kaki".

61
00:04:14,333 --> 00:04:16,915
Namun, Ibu akan sedih jika kakimu patah.

62
00:04:16,916 --> 00:04:18,291
Ibu akan melupakannya.

63
00:04:18,791 --> 00:04:20,207
- Sayang Ibu.
- Sayang kau.

64
00:04:20,208 --> 00:04:21,833
- Dah.
- Dah.

65
00:04:34,958 --> 00:04:36,040
Apa?

66
00:04:36,041 --> 00:04:38,332
Kau bawa topi?
Bisa pakai topi saat audisi.

67
00:04:38,333 --> 00:04:41,665
Akan kubilang bahwa ini bekas cupang,
kau harus setuju.

68
00:04:41,666 --> 00:04:43,248
- Di wajahmu?
- Ya.

69
00:04:43,249 --> 00:04:44,666
Diam. Menyetirlah.

70
00:04:45,374 --> 00:04:46,249
Kawan, itu…

71
00:04:55,791 --> 00:04:58,791
AUDISI UNTUK SEKOLAH MENENGAH WESTRIDGE
WAITRESS

72
00:05:07,958 --> 00:05:10,248
- Selamat pagi, Frank.
- Pagi, Bos.

73
00:05:10,249 --> 00:05:11,708
Semuanya, selamat pagi.

74
00:05:14,458 --> 00:05:15,373
Selamat pagi.

75
00:05:15,374 --> 00:05:16,458
Terima kasih.

76
00:05:16,999 --> 00:05:20,790
- Lenny, roti lapis gulung kale-nya siap?
- Akan siap.

77
00:05:20,791 --> 00:05:22,207
Seharusnya itu di atas bagel.

78
00:05:22,208 --> 00:05:24,665
Kau tak paham. Orang mau yang sehat.

79
00:05:24,666 --> 00:05:27,207
Orang mau makan roti lapis gulung
dan tetap lapar.

80
00:05:27,208 --> 00:05:29,082
Namun, lebih enak untuk bagel.

81
00:05:29,083 --> 00:05:31,498
Kami masih makan bagel. Itu pilihan.

82
00:05:31,499 --> 00:05:35,165
Aku pulang lebih awal.
Aku mau ajak Lizzy ke suatu tempat.

83
00:05:35,166 --> 00:05:36,958
Bercinta di sore hari?

84
00:05:48,416 --> 00:05:51,082
Pastikan kalian membaca bab enam

85
00:05:51,083 --> 00:05:53,916
agar siap untuk diskusi hari Rabu, ya?

86
00:05:54,999 --> 00:05:58,624
Baiklah, sampai di sini.
Jangan lupa, kuisnya minggu depan.

87
00:06:00,374 --> 00:06:01,583
Bagus dan singkat.

88
00:06:03,708 --> 00:06:04,708
Rahang harus relaks.

89
00:06:16,374 --> 00:06:17,665
Bagus.

90
00:06:17,666 --> 00:06:19,415
Kita siap.

91
00:06:19,416 --> 00:06:20,791
Kibaskan tangan.

92
00:06:21,291 --> 00:06:22,458
Pukulan drum.

93
00:06:23,458 --> 00:06:25,666
Mari kita sambut

94
00:06:26,291 --> 00:06:28,998
guru favorit kalian di sebelahku,

95
00:06:28,999 --> 00:06:31,457
sutradara untuk produksi teater ini,

96
00:06:31,458 --> 00:06:35,290
Bu Parker!

97
00:06:35,291 --> 00:06:36,582
Terima kasih!

98
00:06:36,583 --> 00:06:38,748
Terima kasih banyak, Pak Stewart.

99
00:06:38,749 --> 00:06:41,083
Baiklah, Semuanya, ayo mulai!

100
00:06:41,583 --> 00:06:44,207
<i>Akan kulakukan apa saja
untuk meringankan rasa sakitmu</i>

101
00:06:44,208 --> 00:06:47,165
<i>Luapkanlah semuanya
Dan kau tak akan malu</i>

102
00:06:47,166 --> 00:06:50,957
<i>Sial, bagiku tak ada yang lainnya</i>

103
00:06:50,958 --> 00:06:53,790
<i>Kaulah satu-satunya bagiku</i>

104
00:06:53,791 --> 00:06:56,249
<i>Tak bisa kubayangkan hidupku tanpamu</i>

105
00:06:56,999 --> 00:06:59,165
<i>Sial, andai aku yang jadi kekasihmu</i>

106
00:06:59,166 --> 00:07:01,083
Tenang, kau akan tampil memukau.

107
00:07:01,583 --> 00:07:03,665
Menyanyi di depan umum itu menakutkan.

108
00:07:03,666 --> 00:07:06,248
Bayangkan semua orang
memakai pakaian dalam.

109
00:07:06,249 --> 00:07:09,373
<i>Sial, andai aku yang jadi kekasihmu</i>

110
00:07:09,374 --> 00:07:10,623
Sebaiknya jangan.

111
00:07:10,624 --> 00:07:12,707
<i>Mengelilingi dunia ini</i>

112
00:07:12,708 --> 00:07:15,374
- Kecuali Jack.
- Hentikan.

113
00:07:19,458 --> 00:07:23,665
Terima kasih, Trista!
Kau tampak bersenang-senang.

114
00:07:23,666 --> 00:07:24,916
Terima kasih.

115
00:07:25,499 --> 00:07:26,623
Mallory?

116
00:07:26,624 --> 00:07:29,333
- Semangat, Mallory.
- Sophie, manis sekali.

117
00:07:30,249 --> 00:07:31,458
Halo.

118
00:07:32,416 --> 00:07:33,498
Baik.

119
00:07:33,499 --> 00:07:34,748
<i>Berikan aku</i>

120
00:07:34,749 --> 00:07:35,957
- Birama tiga perempat.
- Ayo!

121
00:07:35,958 --> 00:07:37,624
- Kau bisa, Mal!
- Ayo!

122
00:07:44,083 --> 00:07:50,291
<i>Berikan aku sesuatu bernama cinta</i>

123
00:07:50,874 --> 00:07:52,832
<i>Aku menginginkannya</i>

124
00:07:52,833 --> 00:07:58,498
<i>Berikan aku sesuatu bernama cinta</i>

125
00:07:58,499 --> 00:07:59,915
<i>Aku membutuhkannya</i>

126
00:07:59,916 --> 00:08:03,457
Seberapa menggilanya dia
jika dapatkan peran Jenna?

127
00:08:03,458 --> 00:08:04,707
Hentikan. Jangan jahat.

128
00:08:04,708 --> 00:08:08,373
Aku tak jahat! Menggila itu bagus.

129
00:08:08,374 --> 00:08:12,707
<i>…sesuatu bernama cinta</i>

130
00:08:12,708 --> 00:08:13,790
<i>Berikan aku…</i>

131
00:08:13,791 --> 00:08:15,958
Kurasa dia baru saja menggila.

132
00:08:16,916 --> 00:08:22,623
Untuk peran Jenna, aku mau menguji ulang
Hannah Williams dan Mallory Sinclair.

133
00:08:22,624 --> 00:08:23,582
Tentu saja.

134
00:08:23,583 --> 00:08:26,915
Untuk peran Dr. Pomatter,
Jack Davis dan TJ Everett.

135
00:08:26,916 --> 00:08:27,873
Ya, TJ!

136
00:08:27,874 --> 00:08:32,291
Untuk peran Dawn,
Rebecca Lewis dan Sophie Birenbaum.

137
00:08:32,791 --> 00:08:33,957
Untuk peran Becky…

138
00:08:33,958 --> 00:08:36,624
PUSAT KANKER ROOSEVELT

139
00:08:37,416 --> 00:08:41,916
<i>Dr. Lambert, mohon ke ruang pencitraan.</i>

140
00:08:42,666 --> 00:08:44,498
Senang suamimu mengantarmu.

141
00:08:44,499 --> 00:08:46,249
Ya.

142
00:08:47,874 --> 00:08:49,583
Aku belum beri tahu suamiku.

143
00:08:53,708 --> 00:08:55,665
Mau berlatih dengan suamiku?

144
00:08:55,666 --> 00:08:57,416
Elizabeth Birenbaum?

145
00:09:09,083 --> 00:09:10,249
Semoga beruntung.

146
00:09:11,874 --> 00:09:12,874
Terima kasih.

147
00:09:18,083 --> 00:09:20,041
Elizabeth. Ted.

148
00:09:23,583 --> 00:09:25,583
Jenna, pemeran utama kita.

149
00:09:26,083 --> 00:09:28,041
Pelayan di restoran di kota kecil

150
00:09:28,541 --> 00:09:31,041
dan pembuat pai yang luar biasa.

151
00:09:32,624 --> 00:09:35,665
Sebelum meninggal,
ibunya mengajari Jenna membuat kue.

152
00:09:35,666 --> 00:09:38,373
Sekarang, Jenna hamil,

153
00:09:38,374 --> 00:09:41,124
tetapi hubungannya
dengan ayah bayinya buruk.

154
00:09:41,708 --> 00:09:44,582
- Aku mau ke toilet.
- Buang air kecil karena gugup?

155
00:09:44,583 --> 00:09:45,749
Selalu.

156
00:09:47,666 --> 00:09:52,457
<i>Bagaimana jika dia melihatku
Aku menyukainya dan dia tahu?</i>

157
00:09:52,458 --> 00:09:58,415
<i>Bagaimana jika dia membuka hatinya
Dan aku tak bisa menutupnya?</i>

158
00:09:58,416 --> 00:10:00,333
<i>Apa yang akan…</i>

159
00:10:01,708 --> 00:10:02,666
Hai, Ayah.

160
00:10:04,124 --> 00:10:06,290
Bisa berhenti menelepon tak sengaja?

161
00:10:06,291 --> 00:10:08,541
<i>- Apa yang harus kukatakan?
- Entahlah.</i>

162
00:10:10,708 --> 00:10:13,457
<i>Aku tak percaya ini… Tak bisa.</i>

163
00:10:13,458 --> 00:10:14,832
<i>- Aku tahu.
- Aku tak bisa…</i>

164
00:10:14,833 --> 00:10:15,874
<i>Aku tahu.</i>

165
00:10:21,208 --> 00:10:23,415
Lama sekali.
Kau yakin cuma buang air kecil?

166
00:10:23,416 --> 00:10:26,290
- Bisa antar aku pulang?
- Kita belum tampil.

167
00:10:26,291 --> 00:10:29,248
- Tak apa, aku jalan kaki.
- Belajarlah menyetir.

168
00:10:29,249 --> 00:10:31,416
Itu bukan prioritas utama orang tuaku.

169
00:10:33,499 --> 00:10:34,916
Ayo, TJ!

170
00:10:35,708 --> 00:10:37,291
Terima kasih banyak, TJ.

171
00:10:37,874 --> 00:10:39,166
Soph, ada apa?

172
00:10:39,749 --> 00:10:41,041
Sophie Birenbaum?

173
00:10:41,874 --> 00:10:43,041
Sophie.

174
00:10:44,791 --> 00:10:45,624
Sebentar.

175
00:10:47,541 --> 00:10:50,708
Di Stagedoor Manor,
kami diajari teknik pernapasan. Siap?

176
00:10:52,291 --> 00:10:54,832
Tarik napas, dua, tiga.

177
00:10:54,833 --> 00:10:58,041
Tahan, dua, tiga, empat.

178
00:10:58,916 --> 00:11:00,624
Dua, tiga, empat.

179
00:11:02,374 --> 00:11:03,208
Kau bisa.

180
00:11:08,708 --> 00:11:10,623
Hei. Tadi bagus? Ya?

181
00:11:10,624 --> 00:11:11,541
Bagus.

182
00:11:15,833 --> 00:11:17,083
Maaf.

183
00:11:34,374 --> 00:11:38,957
<i>Bagaimana jika dia melihatku
Aku menyukainya dan dia tahu?</i>

184
00:11:38,958 --> 00:11:45,374
<i>Bagaimana jika dia membuka hatinya
Dan aku tak bisa menutupnya?</i>

185
00:11:46,999 --> 00:11:50,748
<i>Apa yang akan terjadi?</i>

186
00:11:50,749 --> 00:11:54,082
<i>Jika saat dia memelukku</i>

187
00:11:54,083 --> 00:11:56,457
<i>Hatiku merasakan sesuatu</i>

188
00:11:56,458 --> 00:12:02,791
<i>Aku tak siap untuk itu
Aku takut patah hati</i>

189
00:12:04,249 --> 00:12:09,333
<i>Namun, aku tetap berharap</i>

190
00:12:12,333 --> 00:12:18,624
<i>Menemukan seseorang untuk diajak bicara</i>

191
00:12:19,583 --> 00:12:25,416
<i>Yang menyukaiku apa adanya</i>

192
00:12:26,291 --> 00:12:31,083
<i>Seseorang yang jika melihatku</i>

193
00:12:32,958 --> 00:12:39,291
<i>Ingin terus melihatku</i>

194
00:12:53,833 --> 00:12:54,791
Hai.

195
00:12:55,416 --> 00:12:57,332
Hei, bagaimana audisinya?

196
00:12:57,333 --> 00:12:59,623
- Baik.
- Giliranku! Aku dulu!

197
00:12:59,624 --> 00:13:00,915
- Hentikan.
- Anak-anak.

198
00:13:00,916 --> 00:13:03,707
- Anak-Anak, pelan-pelan.
- Hei, Kawanku.

199
00:13:03,708 --> 00:13:06,541
Pasti ada cerita lain selain "baik", 'kan?

200
00:13:07,249 --> 00:13:08,166
Entahlah.

201
00:13:08,666 --> 00:13:11,415
Semuanya, ayo ke ruang tamu.

202
00:13:11,416 --> 00:13:13,458
Ibu dan Ayah mau bicara.

203
00:13:13,958 --> 00:13:14,958
Ayo, Soph.

204
00:13:29,749 --> 00:13:31,166
Ibuku sakit lagi.

205
00:13:32,458 --> 00:13:33,291
<i>Tidak.</i>

206
00:13:33,791 --> 00:13:35,833
Mereka bilang Ibu akan melawannya.

207
00:13:36,749 --> 00:13:38,832
Mencari rencana perawatan, tetapi…

208
00:13:38,833 --> 00:13:42,208
Benar. Mereka menemukannya
terakhir kali, jadi…

209
00:13:43,666 --> 00:13:45,208
Aku tak mau orang tahu.

210
00:13:45,708 --> 00:13:47,208
<i>Aku paham.</i>

211
00:13:48,583 --> 00:13:50,374
Aku ada untukmu. Mengerti?

212
00:13:51,249 --> 00:13:52,124
Selalu.

213
00:13:54,916 --> 00:13:57,748
Mereka tak bilang
kalau mau periksa hari ini.

214
00:13:57,749 --> 00:13:59,499
Ibu bahkan tak tampak…

215
00:14:01,958 --> 00:14:03,208
Sudah dulu.

216
00:14:03,749 --> 00:14:04,624
Soph…

217
00:14:45,083 --> 00:14:46,083
<i>Daftar pemeran sudah keluar!</i>

218
00:14:46,749 --> 00:14:50,583
Perhatian, Semua Aktor,
daftar pemeran sudah keluar!

219
00:14:52,999 --> 00:14:54,083
Kau siap?

220
00:14:55,583 --> 00:14:56,624
Entahlah.

221
00:14:58,249 --> 00:15:01,540
- Kau tak harus melakukannya.
- Apa?

222
00:15:01,541 --> 00:15:04,623
Aku tak bermaksud kasar.
Namun, kau baru di tahun kedua.

223
00:15:04,624 --> 00:15:07,082
Kau pernah ikut pelatihan musim panas?

224
00:15:07,083 --> 00:15:09,373
Tunggu, aku bingung. Aku dapat peran Dawn?

225
00:15:09,374 --> 00:15:10,624
Akan kuperiksa.

226
00:15:12,291 --> 00:15:13,541
Aku dapat peran Dawn.

227
00:15:14,291 --> 00:15:15,374
Mal, ayo…

228
00:15:16,958 --> 00:15:18,333
Sophie?

229
00:15:20,666 --> 00:15:21,833
Dia orangnya.

